  "title": "Ask our Expert: Internal Curing of Concrete",
  "summary": "Internal curing is an innovative approach that provides concrete with much-needed internal water, helping prevent early age shrinkage and enhancing cement hydration. With extensive expertise in lightweight aggregates, Clint Chapman explains the mechanics, benefits, and applications of internal curing, sharing insights into how this process can enhance concrete durability and performance. The post Ask our Expert: Internal Curing of Concrete appeared first on Arcosa Lightweight 2026 .",
